# Accessibility (stack)

Generic a11y principles (semantics, keyboard, contrast, DOM order) live in `engineering/frontend`. Below is this stack's a11y wiring.

- Visible focus via Mantine's focus ring or Tailwind's `focus-visible:` variants — don't replace it without an equivalent visible focus style.
- Toasts via `@mantine/notifications` — accessible out of the box (`aria-live` built in); don't hand-roll banners that miss it.
- Don't break Mantine's a11y when overriding: keep `role`, `aria-*`, and keyboard handlers intact. A "styled" Mantine component that drops its semantics is a regression.
